  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Force</mi><mrow><mi>Length</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Time</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>LT</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Dimensions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Power</mi><mi>Area</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Force</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Velocity</mi></mrow><mi>Area</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Dimension of Electric field&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Dimensions of Magnetic field&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Dimension of magnetic permeability&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>MA</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
